"╭ ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Everywhere (continued)                         │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         F4          Room info and members             │ │"
"│ │  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     Menu        Menu for what has the focus       │ │"
"│▌│  Alt-←       Go to the room list               Ctrl-Z      Suspend to the shell              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               Ctrl-Q      Quit                              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages               Room list                                      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                ↑           Previous room                     │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         ↓           Next room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          Enter       Open room and start typing        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                     Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         Del         Delete (own messages)             │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-U       Jump to first unread              t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-O       Filter: Unread only               m           Menu for the message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-D       Filter: People only               End         Jump to newest                    │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       ?           This help                         │─╮"
"│ │  F2          Settings                         Composer                                       │ │"
"╰─│  F3          Next theme                        Enter       Send                              │─╯"
